### GET all categories
GET {{BE_URL}}/categories

### GET categories with filters
GET {{BE_URL}}/categories?status=active&categoryNameVn=Ghế&page=1&limit=10&sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=DESC

### GET categories - filter by name
GET {{BE_URL}}/categories?categoryNameVn=Sofa

### CREATE new category with image
POST {{BE_URL}}/categories
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryNameVn"

Ghế Sofa
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="descriptionVn"

Các loại ghế sofa cao cấp
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

active
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryImage"; filename="sofa.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### CREATE new category without image
POST {{BE_URL}}/categories
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryNameVn"

Bàn làm việc
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="descriptionVn"

Các loại bàn làm việc văn phòng
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

active
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### UPDATE category - Change all fields with new image
PUT {{BE_URL}}/categories/1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryNameVn"

Ghế Sofa Cao Cấp
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="descriptionVn"

Các loại ghế sofa cao cấp nhập khẩu
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

active
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryImage"; filename="sofa-new.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/new-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### UPDATE category - Only change name (partial update)
PUT {{BE_URL}}/categories/1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryNameVn"

Ghế Sofa Hiện Đại
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### UPDATE category - Only change description (partial update)
PUT {{BE_URL}}/categories/1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="descriptionVn"

Mô tả mới cho danh mục ghế sofa
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### UPDATE category - Only change status (partial update)
PUT {{BE_URL}}/categories/1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

inactive
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### UPDATE category - Only change image (partial update)
PUT {{BE_URL}}/categories/1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="categoryImage"; filename="updated-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/updated-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### DELETE category
DELETE {{BE_URL}}/categories/1
